				<section class="elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-4511386 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="4511386" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-b6fd580" data-id="b6fd580" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bb10309 elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-faq" data-id="bb10309" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="elementskit-faq.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="ekit-wid-con" >
                <div class="elementskit-single-faq elementor-repeater-item-4dab2a3">
            <div class="elementskit-faq-header">
                <h2 class="elementskit-faq-title">Do you offer free estimates?</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="elementskit-faq-body">
                Yes, we provide free, no-obligation estimates for all flooring projects. Contact us to schedule your consultation and get a detailed quote tailored to your needs.            </div>
        </div>
                
    </div>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ebf8ddc elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-faq" data-id="ebf8ddc" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="elementskit-faq.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="ekit-wid-con" >
                <div class="elementskit-single-faq elementor-repeater-item-4dab2a3">
            <div class="elementskit-faq-header">
                <h2 class="elementskit-faq-title">What flooring is best for homes with pets?</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="elementskit-faq-body">
                We recommend scratch-resistant options like Luxury Vinyl Plank (LVP), tile, or laminate with a durable wear layer. These materials handle paw traffic and are easy to clean.            </div>
        </div>
                
    </div>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3e8940d elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-faq" data-id="3e8940d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="elementskit-faq.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="ekit-wid-con" >
                <div class="elementskit-single-faq elementor-repeater-item-4dab2a3">
            <div class="elementskit-faq-header">
                <h2 class="elementskit-faq-title">What areas do you serve?</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="elementskit-faq-body">
                We proudly serve residential and commercial customers throughout our region. Contact us to confirm service availability in your specific area.            </div>
        </div>
                
    </div>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9fffda2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-faq" data-id="9fffda2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="elementskit-faq.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="ekit-wid-con" >
                <div class="elementskit-single-faq elementor-repeater-item-4dab2a3">
            <div class="elementskit-faq-header">
                <h2 class="elementskit-faq-title">What is the most durable flooring for high-traffic areas?</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="elementskit-faq-body">
                For high-traffic areas like hallways, living rooms, and entryways, we recommend porcelain tile, Luxury Vinyl Plank (LVP), or engineered hardwood. These materials are designed to resist wear, scratches, and daily use while maintaining a beautiful appearance for years.            </div>
        </div>
                
    </div>				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
				<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-dd5a801" data-id="dd5a801" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-149757e elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-faq" data-id="149757e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="elementskit-faq.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="ekit-wid-con" >
                <div class="elementskit-single-faq elementor-repeater-item-4dab2a3">
            <div class="elementskit-faq-header">
                <h2 class="elementskit-faq-title">Can new flooring be installed over existing floors?</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="elementskit-faq-body">
                In many cases, yes. Depending on the condition of your current flooring, we can often install new flooring directly over it. Our team will assess your subfloor during the consultation.            </div>
        </div>
                
    </div>				</div>
